5. Attendance and completion records;
6. Accrual-accounting instruction;
7. Internal-control instruction;
8. Transaction-documentation instruction;
9. Certificate-of-completion records;
10. Periodic milestone reporting;
11. Maker submission;
OFFICIAL LEDGER AUTHORIZATION REFERENCE:
SOLN-CB-RES-2026-0831-001
12. Separate checker approval;
13. Journal and wallet records; and
14. An audit record.
